    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "First-line biologics for mod-severe dz ⍉controlled w topicals: dupilumab (age 6 and older) or tralokinumab (adults; targets the IL-13-r)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Both given subcutaneously. Dupilumab SE: inj site rxns, eye inflam (conjunctivitis, blepharitis, keratitis, dry eye), HSV infections, eosinophilia. Tralokinumab: URIs, conjunctivitis, inj site rxns, eosinophilia"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Lebrikizumab (Ebglyss): IL-13 antagonist for mod-severe AD in adults and children 12 and older weighing ± 40 kg, ⍉controlled w topical Rx therapies"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Nemolizumab (Nemluvio): IL-31-r antagonist"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
     "indFirst": -18,
     "spaceBefore": 0,
     "spaceAfter": 0,
     "line": null,
     "align": "left",
     "shade": null,
     "borders": null,
     "marker": {
      "text": "•",
      "font": null,
      "marks": [],
      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Nemolizumab for mod-severe AD in adults and children 12 and older, w topical corticosteroids and/or calcineurin inhibitors, when ⍉controlled w topical Rx therapies"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
